    "anchor": "PBPS arXiv2609.06905v1 global source assumptions HTML98-100, Section2.2 HTML168-212, AppendixC1 HTML1197-1237 and background D6/D9 HTML1601-1630; actual reflected conditional score variance. SPHMC2609.06906v1 Section4.1 HTML403-430 has a separate future unreflected covariance consumer. Independent primary-first Centered_Poincare_source_preread.md.",
    "url": "https://arxiv.org/html/2609.06905v1#A3.SS1",
    "original_text": "Exact independently sealed bounded statement:\nSource V C2 and allpoint/allvector0<alpha<=beta curvature; eta>0 and beta*eta<=1. Real finite-dimensional Hilbert/Borel full E including0.\nActual Gaussian joint J, Markov disintegrating R and reflected S_y=(2x-y)#R_y are produced, with true normalized density W_y=V((y+u)/2)+norm(u-y)^2/(8eta), positive integrable partition and original dense closable exact compact-smooth D_y BEFORE ALL centered z/score directions.\nUnnormalized PARAMETER-y score s_y(u)[a]=-DV((y+u)/2)[a]/2-inner(y-u,a)/(4eta). No normalized conditional-density derivative, marginal Poincare or jointly measurable resolvent selector is claimed.\nConstruct actual common source J/R/S and original D_y before all centered z/score a; derive quarter-curvature centered-domain Poincare and true variance of the unnormalized parameter-y directional score bounded by (eta^-1-alpha)^2*norma^2/[4*(alpha+eta^-1)].\nFinite-dimensional real Hilbert/Borel full E including0, genuine C2 W with actual exponential integrability/positive partition, normalized tilted probability, BOTH global mI<=HessW<=MI and0<m<=M. SAME original exact compact-smooth closable weighted gradient D BEFORE all truly mean-zero domain z. Actual positiveepsilon variational solutions from residual/globalcoercivity producers are identified by SAME D/epsilon/forcing uniqueness, then tested against z; strong scaled residual limit and genuine scalar Cauchy-Schwarz/zero-norm branch give m*normz^2<=normDclosurez^2. No uniform unscaled solution bound, centered resolvent, epsilon0 solution, core/range/adjoint certificate or input Poincare. Actual C1 scalar/gradientL2 pairs and centered function are admitted to a genuine original graph, actual probability/AE quotient identities and real integrability produce Admissible and m*Var<=DirichletEnergy. Actual common Gaussian J/R/S, sourceC2 alpha-beta eta cap, reflected W_y, positive partitions and one original D_y precede allcentered z/score directions; actual unnormalized parameter-y score variance <=(eta^-1-alpha)^2*norma^2/(4*(alpha+eta^-1)), with exact reflected m=(alpha+eta^-1)/4 and source-derived upper M=(beta+eta^-1)/4. Auxiliary normalized density equality only; no R2=R/alternateD identification/jointselector or normalized conditional density derivative. BOTH-curvature generic statement is narrower than lower-only source D6 and is disclosed; source companion models supply the upper bound. Anisotropic BL, unreflected linear moments/covariance-upper and SPHMC Hessian lower, outer-y/marginal Poincare, PBPS sampler/reflection/invariance/nonexplosion/hypocoercivity/implementation/cost, SPHMC complete algorithm/Wp/proxywarmness, main results/composition/expectedcost remainopen. TV does not transfer unbounded cost.",
    "text_sha256": "99f3c77ff03f22097206eb43ba4bb397d97023e34c18cc78a1bee5e7ac5b9bf7"
  },
  "lean": {
    "declaration": "AutoSamplingTheory.ExampleCases.ProximalBPS.ConditionalScoreVariance.conditional_centered_domain_and_score_variance",
    "file": "AutoSamplingTheory/ExampleCases/ProximalBPS/ConditionalScoreVariance.lean",
    "statement": "{E : Type*} [NormedAddCommGroup E] [InnerProductSpace ℝ E]\n    [FiniteDimensional ℝ E] [MeasurableSpace E] [BorelSpace E]\n    {V : E → ℝ} {α β : NNReal} {η : ℝ}\n    (hα : 0 < (α:ℝ)) (hαβ : α ≤ β) (hV : ContDiff ℝ 2 V)\n    (hH : ∀ x a : E, (α:ℝ)*‖a‖^2 ≤ fderiv ℝ (fderiv ℝ V) x a a ∧\n      fderiv ℝ (fderiv ℝ V) x a a ≤ (β:ℝ)*‖a‖^2)\n    (hη : 0 < η) (hβη : (β:ℝ)*η ≤ 1) :\n    let μ := (volume : Measure E).tilted (fun x => -V x)\n    let J := Measure.map (fun p : E × E => (p.1,p.1+Real.sqrt η • p.2))\n      (μ.prod (stdGaussian E))\n    let W := fun y u : E => V ((1/2:ℝ) • (y+u))+‖u-y‖^2/(8*η)\n    let s := fun y u : E => -(1/2:ℝ) • fderiv ℝ V ((1/2:ℝ) • (y+u)) -\n      (1/(4*η)) • innerSL ℝ (y-u)\n    ∃ R S : Kernel E E, IsMarkovKernel R ∧ IsMarkovKernel S ∧\n      (J.map Prod.swap).IsCondKernel R ∧\n      (∀ y, S y=(R y).map (fun x => (2:ℝ) • x-y)) ∧\n      ∀ y, S y=(volume : Measure E).tilted (fun u => -W y u) ∧\n        ContDiff ℝ 2 (W y) ∧ Integrable (fun u => Real.exp (-W y u)) ∧\n        0 < ∫ u, Real.exp (-W y u) ∧\n        ∃ D : Lp ℝ 2 (S y) →ₗ.[ℝ] Lp E 2 (S y),\n          Dense (D.domain : Set (Lp ℝ 2 (S y))) ∧ D.IsClosable ∧ D.closure.IsClosed ∧\n          (∀ (a : Lp ℝ 2 (S y)) (G : Lp E 2 (S y)), (a,G) ∈ D.graph ↔\n            ∃ φ : E → ℝ, ContDiff ℝ ∞ φ ∧ HasCompactSupport φ ∧\n              a =ᵐ[S y] φ ∧ G =ᵐ[S y] gradient φ) ∧\n          (∀ z : D.closure.domain, (∫ x, (z : Lp ℝ 2 (S y)) x ∂S y)=0 →\n            (((α:ℝ)+1/η)/4)*‖(z : Lp ℝ 2 (S y))‖^2 ≤ ‖D.closure z‖^2) ∧\n          ∀ a : E,\n            AutoSamplingTheory.TechnicalLemmas.FunctionalInequalities.Poincare.Admissible\n              (S y) (fun u => s y u a) ∧\n            AutoSamplingTheory.TechnicalLemmas.FunctionalInequalities.Poincare.variance\n              (S y) (fun u => s y u a) ≤\n                (1/η-(α:ℝ))^2/(4*((α:ℝ)+1/η))*‖a‖^2",
    "statement_sha256": "e2f61b96c18836ea5e4f8c5b88fc5f396df68e5fc8a297d973e657e094f5e039",
    "compiled": true,
    "formalizer": "root-samplinglib-writer",
    "decoder_context": [
      "Actual original compact-smooth weighted-gradient closure, finite-dimensional real Hilbert/Borel fullspace including0. BOTH C2 m/M curvature, exp(-W) integrability/positive partition explicit in canonical nodes; not full lower-only source D6.",
      "Same-D/epsilon/forcing actual variational witnesses are identified by genuine uniqueness before transferring global gradient bound; strong scaled residual tested against centered z proves Poincare after zero-norm split. No supplied Poincare/coercivity/limit certificate or centered/unscaled resolvent/epsilon0 premise.",
      "Actual C1 scalar+gradientL2 centering produces original graph pair; derive real Admissible integrability and AE L2 norm/variance/Dirichlet identities.",
      "Source C2 alpha-beta eta cap actual commonJRS/reflected W_y/positive partitions/originalD beforeALLcentered z/score a. Exact quarter m_y=(alpha+eta^-1)/4, M_y=(beta+eta^-1)/4 and unnormalized PARAMETER-y score variance constant (eta^-1-alpha)^2/[4*(alpha+eta^-1)].",
      "R/S existential common-law witnesses, not project-owned canonical chosen definitions. Auxiliary versions only pointwise formulas/literal density equality; no R2=R/alternateD/jointselector. No normalized score differentiation, marginal Poincare, anisotropicBL/main/composition; TV nevertransfers unboundedcost.",
      "Exact existing compiled API definitions (same actual measure; no energy prefactor):\nnoncomputable def variance (μ : Measure E) (f : E → ℝ) : ℝ :=\n  ∫ x, (f x - ∫ y, f y ∂μ) ^ 2 ∂μ\n\nnoncomputable def dirichletEnergy (μ : Measure E) (f : E → ℝ) : ℝ :=\n  ∫ x, ‖gradient f x‖ ^ 2 ∂μ\n\ndef Admissible (μ : Measure E) (f : E → ℝ) : Prop :=\n  Integrable f μ ∧\n    Integrable (fun x => (f x - ∫ y, f y ∂μ) ^ 2) μ ∧\n    Integrable (fun x => ‖gradient f x‖ ^ 2) μ\nExact real Hilbert gradient: gradient f x = (InnerProductSpace.toDual ℝ E).symm (fderiv ℝ f x). This is the actual Riesz representative; C1 assumptions ensure genuine derivatives in the public consumers."
    ],
    "compiler_evidence": "Focused3885/standard3; independent statement/source-topology preproof accepted. Wholemath/blind/finalsource/exact/integration/exposition pending."
