    "evidence": "Complete current ConditionalScoreVariance108 lines: actual common source law/domain, auxiliary only fiber Hessian formula, true score L2/C1, nonnegative pointwise bound and normalized integration/division. No hidden operator identity. Complete source contract and anonymous reconstruction compared in all seven slots; full current three-module bundle and136-line true nonquadratic/0D Test and all18 reader steps checked, including exact called ASTIS/Mathlib provenance. All three publication bindings independently recomputed from live full module, toolchain/manifest, actual item/full binding and full lesson. Six admin diffs individually checked; all remaining frozen input bytes unchanged. No compiler in this source task. Scoped canonical B/B and genuine conditional SourceAnchor accepted; not full lower-only D6, normalized conditional derivative, marginal PI, anisotropic BL, unreflected covariance/SPHMC Hessian consumer or main/composition acceptance.",
