      "statement": "Construct actual common source J/R/S and original D_y before all centered z/score a; derive quarter-curvature centered-domain Poincare and true variance of the unnormalized parameter-y directional score bounded by (eta^-1-alpha)^2*norma^2/[4*(alpha+eta^-1)].",
      "formula": "m_y=\\frac{\\alpha+\\eta^{-1}}4,\\quad s_y(u)[a]=-\\frac12DV((y+u)/2)[a]-\\frac{\\langle y-u,a\\rangle}{4\\eta},\\quad\\operatorname{Var}_{S_y}(s_y[a])\\le\\frac{(\\eta^{-1}-\\alpha)^2}{4(\\alpha+\\eta^{-1})}\\|a\\|^2.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "title": "Retain the genuine common law and domain order",
          "text": "Accepted conditional score domain constructs source Gaussian J, Markov R/S, actual disintegration/reflection, positive integrable W_y partition and original D_y before all centered z and score directions. R/S remain existential witnesses.",
          "formula": "S_y=(2x-y)_\\#R_y=Z_y^{-1}e^{-W_y}du.",
